OL,3,GNEWSAPrice defends Welsh budget after  
OL,4,Abusiness groups voice concerns         
OL,6,FEnterprise minister Adam Price has     
OL,7,Fdefended the Welsh government's draft  
OL,8,Fbudget after some of the country's     
OL,9,Fleading business groups warned it does 
OL,10,Fnot do enough to support growth and    
OL,11,Finvestment in the private sector.      
OL,13,FThe Confederation of British Industry  
OL,14,F(CBI) said firms would be disappointed 
OL,15,Fby a budget which "does little to      
OL,16,Ftackle the high costs and uncertainty" 
OL,17,Ffacing businesses.                     
OL,23,APub: 19-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
